  "Scenes.Sylviascene.SylviaSecondMeeting.NothingEventfulThickerMire": "[pg]Nothing eventful happens on your way to the thicker parts of this murky mire, but going into that unnerving gloom once again does send a shiver down your spine. You plod through the muck for some time, but just like you remember from your first journey, there aren't any signs of life here. Just as you're thinking about giving up, you feel a slight prickle on the back of your neck before four delicate arms wrap around you from behind."
